# Cities in Motion RE workspace and the ReGS source port.
# The repository holds only our own work: the port's sources and data, the RE docs and the tools. Game files and
# anything copied or generated from them stay out, so the repository can be published like OpenRCT2 (the player
# brings the original game).

# game files extracted from the archives, and decompiled pseudocode of the game's binaries
/extracted/
/decompiled/
# sample maps and saves (game data and copies of the user's saves)
/samples/
# raw string dump of GSystem.dll
/docs/gsystem-strings.txt

# port build output and test runs (stand-in Documents folders with saves, settings, logs and screenshots)
/port/build/
/port/run/

# editors and OS
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
